          "date": "2026-10-30 23:03:58.000000000",
          "tz": -420
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Di Wang",
          "email": "diwa@nvidia.com",
          "date": "2026-11-03 23:26:37.000000000",
          "tz": -480
        },
        "subject": "LU-21061 lmv: count only pool MDTs in pool quota usage",
        "message": "LU-21061 lmv: count only pool MDTs in pool quota usage\n\n\"lfs quota --pool\" sums the block usage of the OSTs of a pool, but\nthe inode and DoM usage of every MDT, so a pool with inode limits\nreports usage that it does not limit.\n\nPass the pool to lmv_quotactl(), which then sums only the MDTs of\nthe pool if it lists any.  A pool without MDTs still reports the\nusage of all MDTs.  Also list the MDTs of the pool in\n\"lfs quota -v --pool\".\n\nTest-Parameters: mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=\"1 92\"\nSigned-off-by: Di Wang <diwa@nvidia.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 ltvm\nChange-Id: I0bf720b563c036cfe8770cbbcecee6948372e4b0\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
